" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" href=\"?note=5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" title=\"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics\">73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.1–6.3, print pp. 224–252; PDF pp. 246–274; local typed PDA interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§5.3, Theorems 5.1–5.4, pp. 114–120; local mode/grammar correspondence"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_F\">\\(L_F\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\varnothing}\">\\(L_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> (PDA acceptance modes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" href=\"?note=5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" title=\"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics\">73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_F(M)=L_{\\varnothing}(N))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_F(M)=L_{\\varnothing}(N))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_{\\varnothing}(N)=L_F(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_{\\varnothing}(N)=L_F(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To pass from final-state to empty-stack acceptance, add a fresh bottom marker and an epsilon-driven drain state reachable from every old final state.</li>\n<li>反向转换加入新底标记，标记暴露时用 ε 步进入新终态；机器不必在这一步检测输入结束。终态接受语义另要求输入余词为空，故提前暴露标记的分支不会接受尚未读完的词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":